sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant API as apps/api (RunsController)
  participant Redis
  participant Metrics
  participant Queue as queue:agent-runs

  Client->>API: POST /api/v1/runs (startRun)
  Note right of API: apps/api/src/api/runs.controller.ts:55-158 startRun
  API->>API: Validate (StartRunSchema.parse)
  alt Validation OK
    API->>API: uuidv4() runId
    API->>Redis: setex run:runId JSON (TTL 24h)
    API->>Redis: sadd tenant:tenantId:runs runId (expire 24h)
    API->>API: queueRun(runId, validatedData)
    API->>Queue: lpush queue:agent-runs {runId, tenantId, userId, prompt}
    API->>Metrics: requestCounter + agentRunCounter
    API-->>Client: 201 { run }
    alt Continue next
      Client->>API: POST /api/v1/runs/:runId/continue (continueRun)
      API-->>Client: 200 { run }
    else Cancel next
      Client->>API: POST /api/v1/runs/:runId/cancel (cancelRun)
      API-->>Client: 200 { run }
    end
  else Validation Error
    API-->>Client: 400 { error: VALIDATION_ERROR }
  end
  opt Internal Failure
    API-->>Client: 500 { error: INTERNAL_ERROR }
  end
